Time (ns)	object_detected	bin_full	lid_open	full_led	Operation
0–20	0	0	0	0	Reset / lid closed
20–30	1	0	1	0	Object detected → lid opens
30–130	0	0	1	0	Lid remains open
~140	0	0	0	0	Lid closes automatically
150–180	0	1	0	1	Bin full → LED ON, lid closed
180–210	0	0	0	0	Bin emptied → normal operation
